** ------------------------------------------------------------
** CalculiX Steel Cantilever Beam Modal Benchmark (10 Modes)
** Uses the same mesh & BCs as beam_benchmark.
** 20x20mm cross-section, 300mm long, C3D20 elements.
** Fixed at z=0 (NNFIX).
** ------------------------------------------------------------
*INCLUDE, INPUT=all.msh
*INCLUDE, INPUT=NFIX.nam
*INCLUDE, INPUT=NTIP.nam

*MATERIAL, NAME=STEEL
*ELASTIC
210000.0, 0.3
*DENSITY
7.85e-9

*SOLID SECTION, ELSET=Eall, MATERIAL=STEEL

*BOUNDARY
NNFIX, 1, 3, 0.0

*STEP
*FREQUENCY
10

*NODE FILE
U
*EL FILE
S
*END STEP
